# 3. Stun slots open fights: slot_stun(slot) > 0 is cast at the nearest enemy in slot range before damage slots.
# 4. Engagement still uses cast_on for non-stun abilities, so the bot does not waste cooldowns.
# 5. Treasure/jungle emblem shards were dropped: plain stat shards are cheaper to stack and easier to use.
# Base: tune-fight-2 style loop (camp walks, altar tributes, altar lock, retreat at low health).

